   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Borders protection assistance - customs officer serving as an expert within the European Border Assistance Mission on the Moldovan-Ukrainian border (&quot;EUBAM&quot;), 1.1.2021 - 31.8.2021.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
